  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to ensure sustainable value chains of oil palm, coffee, rice and cocoa through an application of a comprehensive land use approach linking biodiversity conservation, restoration, and production at scale. The project is implemented in 5 provinces (jurisdictions) and 5 districts (pilot landscapes): Aceh (Central Aceh), North Sumatra (Mandailing Natal), West Kalimantan (Sanggau), South Sulawesi (Luwu) and West Papua (Sorong). The project is expected to generate multiple benefits fo</narrative>
  </description>
